# The weather's scripts (weather-drizzle, -rain, -downpour): as fidelity.script (the native build and the WebAssembly
# build both play them and must show the same pixels), each with a weather told (weather <kind 0..3> <s>: wm_weather).
# A drizzle told for 40 s with no date (no sky): it eases in, a touch in the rain, it runs out and eases back to clear,
# the floor wet; then a quarter of an hour in one step (the clock counts the time the screen was off) and it is dry:
# once the last drops' water settles (half a second) the frames are those with no weather told, pixel for pixel
# (weather_flow_test.c). fidelity.script tells none: its frames have no weather.
creature cat packages/cat/cat.json
package packages/astrology/astrology.json
start 466 20261122 0
frames 60 33333
weather 1 40
frames 900 33333
touch 1 233 415
frames 2 33333
touch 0 0 0
frames 360 33333
frames 1 900000000
frames 120 33333
